variations</strong> of monsters: shiny/aggressive/photosensitive/gluttonous!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow baby monsters</strong> that run around in your basement from rare eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw magic sigils </strong>to capture monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer disturbing voice calls</strong> from potential monster buyers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and expand</strong> your basement, gear, and creature cages. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new dungeons</strong> and dive deeper &amp; capture scarier and more valuable monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate</strong> the feeding and collecting of resources from monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon modifiers</strong> to find mid-run that completely change the dungeon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret portals</strong> and other entrances within dungeons leading to secret dungeons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op or singleplayer, 1-4 players!</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Capture monsters and throw physics objects in shifting dungeons! Farm, feed, sacrifice, and sell them from your basement. 1-4 players horror dungeon crawling X creature collection &amp; farming! R.E.P.O. meets Slime Rancher / Horror Pokémon!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862890/b15dc6b63890e0b66a5f83d639ce154dc1c53f44/header.jpg?t=1773402423", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862890/9d6d662f0049ef67e66058cc2d04ce6c117bb37e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773402423", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass